  "limitations": [
    "This experiment executes only the exact dependency-free repository fixture; arbitrary local and npm MCP V2 dispatch remains disabled.",
    "The proposer and outcome predictor are deterministic local model-shaped fixtures; this validates orchestration and authority separation, not live-model proposal quality.",
    "The controller review identity is a trusted local test boundary and is not an externally authenticated human signature.",
    "The returned treatment content was never shown to a model, so the experiment proves the reference-monitor and quarantine path rather than model robustness to tool-result injection.",
    "Document content is the intended treatment variable, but case, step, origin, resource path, argument digest, and prediction identifiers also differ between arms.",
    "The exact sandbox image is deliberately host/platform-specific and fails closed after an unreviewed rebuild.",
    "Lexical indicators are bounded, first-match signals with possible false positives and false negatives; they are evidence, not a maliciousness or safety verdict.",
    "Target drift checks bind regular-file paths and bytes for the pinned fixture but are not a race-free, metadata-complete filesystem snapshot for arbitrary code.",
